{
 "format": "webtracker",
 "version": 1,
 "song": {
  "name": "round the circle",
  "bpm": 118,
  "ticksPerBeat": 4,
  "length": 256,
  "loop": {
   "start": 0,
   "end": 256
  },
  "info": "A demo for the chord helpers in the Script tab. The pad, bass and arpeggio lanes were written by scripts (the script is in the Script tab): the first eight bars walk the circle of fifths in A minor (Am7 Dm7 G7 Cmaj7 Fmaj7 Bm7b5 E7 Am7), the second eight come from progression(8, \"A\", \"minor\", ...), a suggested progression that ends back on the home chord. The pad uses lead: true so each chord moves as little as it can from the one before.",
  "script": "const A = ['Am7', 'Dm7', 'G7', 'Cmaj7', 'Fmaj7', 'Bm7b5', 'E7', 'Am7'];                 // down the circle of fifths in A minor\nconst B = progression(8, 'A', 'minor', { style: 'pop', sevenths: true, spice: 0.25, seed: 5 });   // eight chords that end back home\ntbin('x...............', chords(A, { lead: true, octave: 3 }), { at: 0, to: 127, vel: 0x58 });\ntbin('x...............', chords(B, { lead: true, octave: 3 }), { at: 128, to: 255, vel: 0x58 });\ntbin('..............x.', voices('===', '===', '===', '==='), { keep: true });\n\n// ---- the bass lane ----\nconst roots = list => list.flatMap(c => Array(4).fill(c));     // four hits on each chord\ntbin('..x...x...x...x.', chords(roots(A), { octave: 1, max: 1 }), { at: 32, to: 127, vel: [0xE0, 0x98, 0xB8, 0x98] });\ntbin('x..x..x...x.x...', chords(B.flatMap(c => Array(5).fill(c)), { octave: 1, max: 1 }), { at: 128, to: 255, vel: [0xE0, 0x98, 0xB8, 0x98, 0xA8] });\n\n// ---- the arpeggio lane ----\n// eleven notes a bar, walking up and down the notes of the chord\nconst walk = [0, 1, 2, 3, 2, 1, 0, 2, 3, 2, 1];\nconst line = list => list.flatMap(c => { const n = chord(c, { octave: 4, max: 4 }).split(' '); return walk.map(i => n[i % n.length]); });\ntbin(euclid(11, 16), voices(line(A).join(' ')), { at: 64, to: 127, vel: [0xA8, 0x70, 0x88, 0x68] });\ntbin(euclid(11, 16, 3), voices(line(B).join(' ')), { at: 128, to: 255, vel: [0xA8, 0x70, 0x88, 0x68, 0x80] });\n"
 },
